{"version":1,"content":"<p>今晨（27日）9時許，葵涌道近葵榮路發生三車相撞意外，涉及1輛專線小巴及2輛貨車，據報有人被困，警方及救援人員接報趕至現場救援。</p><p>現場消息指，意外中至少有3男6女受傷，包括小巴上多名乘客，其中一名傷者為孕婦，傷者由救援人員檢查傷勢後，分別送院。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T03:21:34.474762+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T02:32:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T03:38:11.242909+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T03:18:29.845141+00:00","content_hash":"213934da8053f37e52018881b37063f6ef4fa69603e07f0b2e293711b65b5389","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}